license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/cmfsx/SlicerOsteotomyCuts"
url: "https://github.com/cmfsx/SlicerOsteotomyCuts"
abstract: >-
  A 3D Slicer extension for virtual osteotomies in orthognathic and
  craniofacial surgical planning: osteotomy lines drawn on a bone model are
  cut along a saw direction with a set blade thickness and depth, several
  lines can form one osteotomy, cuts can be mirrored across a midline plane,
  and the bone is divided into closed bone segments, with checks of model
  quality and of the distance to the nerve canal and tooth roots. Research
  and planning software, not a medical device.
keywords:
  - 3D Slicer
  - osteotomy
  - virtual surgical planning
  - oral and maxillofacial surgery
  - orthognathic surgery
